"""Deterministic verifier for the sealb-ctl security policy-compiler task.

Independent re-derivation: every expectation is recomputed here from the
shipped evidence embedded below, never read from the agent's answer files.
Negative checks are polarity-inverted; their assertions hold only when a cheat
is present, so an honest run leaves them failing and keeps the negative weight.
"""
